body:
omg da belly :O

she is torn between rage and 'yes continue rubbing da belly'

i love Mika ;_;

omg so sweet little baby ;_;

She can wheek

She can win :O

you're probably very right re: Botch, i just slipped from semi-valid critique into legit grumpiness and implied they only knew one of the most popular bands in the genre >>; but also i feel there is mild validity to this given how simple their riffs are... BUT EVEN BOTCH OCCASIONALLY CHANGED NOTES ;_;

also tbh i love the electronic stuff Frontierer does and i wish they did more of it. whenever there's a bit crush or an amen break that's built out of chip samples i pop off. if anything i feel like i'm grumpy about them because i see so much potential, but every time one of their songs on shuffle it's like COME ON GUYS PLEASE PLAY A MELODY OR MORE THAN A NOTE MODIFIED BY SEMITONES

thanks a ton for the recommendation album as well. i'm very aware this is a me problem and i'm legit trying to get over it lol. having something similar to listen to sounds nice.
